{"4628630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vertical Momentum Revival", "steam_appid": 4628630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compliment your playstyle with a variety of movement abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.poster.avif?t=1776721151\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.webm?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.mp4?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No invisibility. No grenade launchers. Just weapons and your own pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tanks or healers to rely on. Kill or be killed. Fast paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No choke points. No campers. Enjoy the fast paced vertical movement where every wall is climbable. Multiple number of paths available to any part of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple different game types. Solo or with friends. Host your own lobbies with your own settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of different weapons - and don't underestimate the melee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community based project. Create and upload your own maps with the provided tools, and play them with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.poster.avif?t=1776721151\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.webm?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.mp4?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**This project started in late March 2026 and is currently in early alpha greyboxing mode. Gameplay/mechanics first, artstyle later.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compliment your playstyle with a variety of movement abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.poster.avif?t=1776721151\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.webm?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/d9d597d786f6f9c2797e5d1c70038b62.mp4?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No invisibility. No grenade launchers. Just weapons and your own pure skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tanks or healers to rely on. Kill or be killed. Fast paced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No choke points. No campers. Enjoy the fast paced vertical movement where every wall is climbable. Multiple number of paths available to any part of the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between multiple different game types. Solo or with friends. Host your own lobbies with your own settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a wide variety of different weapons - and don't underestimate the melee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community based project. Create and upload your own maps with the provided tools, and play them with others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.poster.avif?t=1776721151\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.webm?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/extras/46ffbe1b21c871d87e274db8c9365f46.mp4?t=1776721151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**This project started in late March 2026 and is currently in early alpha greyboxing mode. Gameplay/mechanics first, artstyle later.</p>", "short_description": "Engage in fast paced vertical PVP combat. Jump straight into the action on the rooftops, or flank your enemy through the alleyways below. Choose from a variety of movement abilities to compliment your playstyle. Play any existing maps, or create your own!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4628630/46a551c5faaf1243b13ef659bce06b4f4b62ec09/header.jpg?t=1776721151", "capsule_image": "h